# PySide6 GUI adapters

This project uses the shared PySide6 runtime owned by `D:\PythonProject_langgraph`.

Keep project business dependencies in the project runtime. Use this adapter folder for
small, explicit boundaries between the GUI shell and the project's own CLI, HTTP API,
local IPC, worker process, configuration directory, data directory, logging, or
diagnostics surfaces.

Do not install business packages into the shared PySide6 runtime. Do not launch a
visible GUI from automated checks unless the operator explicitly requests interactive
verification.
